WEBVTT

00:10:27.876 --> 00:10:30.716
there are a lot of real problems.

00:10:31.076 --> 00:10:36.636
And I think that these questions
of algorithmic control

00:10:36.676 --> 00:10:38.036
play a lot into them.

00:10:39.436 --> 00:10:41.596
We're talking right now about the role

00:10:41.636 --> 00:10:44.236
that Facebook had
in the American election.

00:10:45.716 --> 00:10:47.076
There are a lot of questions

00:10:47.076 --> 00:10:51.916
about the ways that these algorithms
are controlling our lives.

00:10:52.956 --> 00:10:54.156
And so, I don't know,

00:10:54.196 --> 00:10:56.876
I don't know what I'm saying

00:10:56.916 --> 00:10:59.916
and I don't have, like,
a very clear conclusion.